Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.06,0:00:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're shining, running, forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.08,0:00:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is calling out, so ride the waves!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.94,0:00:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all together as one,\Nso let's sail in the sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.64,0:00:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All our dreams are never-ending, so\Nlet's wake up, wake up, wake up, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.94,0:00:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Heartbeat, we will be one! Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.54,0:00:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though our hearts have\Ntraveled different paths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.64,0:00:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We are best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.26,0:00:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Our freedom is our only compass.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.10,0:00:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's pointing us along the\Nmany roads that come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.28,0:00:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We will keep on running forward every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.60,0:00:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Go east, go west.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.98,0:00:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we keep looking to the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.74,0:00:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see everything all crystal clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.60,0:00:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all so thrilled that we\Ncan't wait until the dawn arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.90,0:00:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So we'll just bring the\Nsun ourselves to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.60,0:00:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If the winds blow, it's waiting\Nwhere we should be going. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.64,0:01:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, we're\Nshining, running forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.30,0:01:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All of our dreams will\Nmerge into one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.34,0:01:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where we go,\Nwe'll be fine and free.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.06,0:01:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause all our treasure is our strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.78,0:01:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're shining, running forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.36,0:01:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is coming out, so ride away!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.42,0:01:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all together as well, so\Nlet's just stay with us, son!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.24,0:01:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,All our dreams are never-ending, so\Nlet's wake up, wake up, wake up, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.48,0:01:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Heartbeat, we will be one! Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.40,0:01:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,My darkness will swallow the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.44,0:01:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Just you wait and see!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.38,0:01:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'll lose to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.36,0:01:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be king of the pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.84,0:01:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger's treasure belongs to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.44,0:01:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll ride non-stop and travel farther.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.70,0:01:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,than we've ever gone And then tomorrow we
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.36,0:01:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,will find suspense And then commence to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.44,0:02:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Live out another day so intense.\NThat's right, we're shining,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.28,0:02:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Running forever. Let's go along\Nwith curiosity. Our feelings lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.32,0:02:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,the way straight to a brand new day Into\Nanother adventure Come on, we're shining,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.22,0:02:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,running forever Open the map inside your\Nheart and see No matter where we end up,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.86,0:02:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Our mods will never give up. There's a\Nfire in our dreams and you can never,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.94,0:02:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,never, never, never stop it\NWe will be one, go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.82,0:02:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No one's coming to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.96,0:02:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And not a single soul will be able\Nto leave the birdcage. Hello? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.96,0:02:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, it's also useless\Nto call for outside help.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.04,0:02:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Not one solitary, pathetic\Nwhimper can escape this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.76,0:02:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite the predicament.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.54,0:02:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to be killed by\Nthe people you trust the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.74,0:02:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! Somebody!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.16,0:03:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hurt my family!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.24,0:03:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Your neighbors,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.42,0:03:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,friends, and loved ones will continue\Nto rampage, killing anyone in their way,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.78,0:03:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,even you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.90,0:03:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.18,0:03:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear I don't want to hurt you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.40,0:03:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.68,0:03:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.98,0:03:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't fight it! Get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.86,0:03:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's pointless to run and hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.78,0:03:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll find that there's no safe\Nplace to be in the birdcage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.52,0:03:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll only be met with terror\Nthat'll last for days on end.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.32,0:03:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only two ways this can stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.62,0:03:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Either you all die out, or\Nyou meet my win conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.78,0:03:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn that Doflamingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.72,0:03:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You can never predict his next move!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.66,0:03:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe the factory somehow\Nup and disappeared like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.68,0:03:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,How is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.70,0:03:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.64,0:04:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our chance to scram!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.34,0:04:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We can finally escape this hellhole!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.42,0:04:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Long last, I never thought\NI'd live to see the game!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.36,0:04:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Praise be to the almighty Garp!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.94,0:04:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Amen to that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.20,0:04:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.36,0:04:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Kin'emon, I'm glad you're all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.76,0:04:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Metal breastbands.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.56,0:04:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed, this is quite the foreign culture.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.82,0:04:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Splendid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.73,0:04:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Robin, can I be a slave?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.18,0:04:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I mean, can I ask you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.22,0:04:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, so like that guy's nose?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.34,0:04:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,To me, it has more than a passing\Nresemblance to Sniper Kings.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.56,0:04:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The guy who shot down the\Nflag at the Tower of Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.28,0:04:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.58,0:04:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,His name is Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.18,0:04:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And to think he's here with Ms.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.78,0:04:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin, Who was moved by\Nthe actions of a crew,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.52,0:04:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,who turned against the whole world!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.20,0:04:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,in order to save one of their mates!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.36,0:04:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm blessed by the Edie's Lobby duo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.64,0:04:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.70,0:04:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you stop geeking out for a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.06,0:04:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Just shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.54,0:05:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the same kid who broke my wrist.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.60,0:05:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I leave these Lilliputian\Nwarriors in your care.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.46,0:05:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Though tiny in stature,\Nthey're rich in courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.90,0:05:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Topnotland!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.81,0:05:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,How kind of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.00,0:05:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We found them like this in the palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.16,0:05:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They're in pretty rough\Nshape, but they fought hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.00,0:05:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We're so proud of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.86,0:05:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Great job, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.40,0:05:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop me! Somebody!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.64,0:05:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,My body is out of control!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.62,0:05:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This is exactly like the\Ntragedy from a decade ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.82,0:05:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.73,0:05:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I know the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.50,0:05:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That night King Rick attacked us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.44,0:05:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't his fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.30,0:05:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He was manipulated.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.34,0:05:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Manipulated
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.42,0:05:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,by Doflamingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.24,0:05:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You're angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.30,0:05:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Then scream.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.04,0:05:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.26,0:05:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll all eventually become\Ncasualties of this wicked game.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.24,0:05:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Help my boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.70,0:06:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The flamingo stops this lunacy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.86,0:06:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Think it over?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.24,0:06:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you attempt to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.22,0:06:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Or will you spare yourselves\Nand join my family?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.30,0:06:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,All that I'm asking you to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.02,0:06:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Is hold just 12 fools accountable\Nfor rebelling against me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.56,0:06:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If you make the wrong choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.38,0:06:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never get to see the\Nend result of this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.94,0:06:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The stars will be worth\N100 million berries each.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.08,0:06:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The following individuals\Nwill be your ticket out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.28,0:06:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Army commander Keros wasn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.54,0:06:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The invincible gladiator.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.50,0:06:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He listed pirates too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.48,0:06:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw the Straw Hat crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.12,0:06:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Violet was princess Viola,\Nbut she's with the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.28,0:07:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, let's move on\Nto the head honchos.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.48,0:07:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I present to you the three stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.70,0:07:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Law and Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.24,0:07:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Who'd have thought we'd be hunting\Nthe alliance that shocked the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.68,0:07:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The king?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.26,0:07:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He was still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.94,0:07:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor King Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.66,0:07:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He's from the Revolutionary Army.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.78,0:07:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's their chief of staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.64,0:07:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you've got fans!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.38,0:07:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.96,0:07:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's a relief
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.90,0:07:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad I didn't make the list.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.08,0:07:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And finally,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.64,0:07:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,there's one man in\Nparticular who aroused my
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.30,0:07:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,indignation and resentment\Nmore than the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.06,0:07:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You can direct all complaints\Nto this guy as he's the
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.18,0:07:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,reason you're all forced\Nto play this ruthless game.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.22,0:07:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And the person who kills him\Nwill get a hearty reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.00,0:07:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Five hundred million berries!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.96,0:08:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.10,0:08:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear that, Usalind?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.56,0:08:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Five stars, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.98,0:08:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I spot a pair of one stars\Nand a three star, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.28,0:08:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want us to do, Sabo?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.16,0:08:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We should make our escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.82,0:08:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Get to the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.02,0:08:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.93,0:08:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta die!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.20,0:08:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive us, God, Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.50,0:08:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's live in the lap of luxury!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.54,0:08:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,These traders were all worshipping\Nme just a few minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.54,0:08:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.04,0:08:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.82,0:08:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.54,0:08:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's one of them too, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.00,0:08:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He's worth a hundred million!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.06,0:08:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.44,0:08:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This is quite vexing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.02,0:08:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If I recall, this is the Scrappy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.64,0:09:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,don't you know are you there please\Nrespond the 100 million berries
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.20,0:09:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.10,0:09:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,have
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.24,0:09:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,little time for
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.15,0:09:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,indecisiveness the longer this takes
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.72,0:09:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,the more people fall the more\Nbuildings burn I don't know this
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.94,0:09:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,feels wrong now that we know King\NRico is innocent all this time
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.96,0:09:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What if everyone in town teams?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.14,0:09:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,up then we might have a shot at
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.98,0:09:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,taking doflamingo out it's not\Njust him though he's got at least
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.28,0:09:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,2 000 people in his family and i\Nbet they're more than willing to
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.82,0:09:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,throw their lives on the line for\Nhim what are we supposed to do
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.92,0:09:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,king rico is near the\Ntop of the most wanted
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.28,0:09:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,list maybe it's okay if\Nwe take them in alive
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.78,0:09:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Like, if we apprehend them,\Nthat might be good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.86,0:09:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What else can we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.38,0:09:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We're out of options!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.62,0:10:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Agreed. Fine. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.82,0:10:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Could have sworn that Cyborg\Nwas down for the count.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.56,0:10:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did he run off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.00,0:10:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Buried!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.92,0:10:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Piss off, you goons!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.80,0:10:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.90,0:10:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.66,0:10:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Saru? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.34,0:10:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.68,0:10:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, uh, I think it's\Ncalled the King's Plateau.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.36,0:10:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'm here with Luffy's group.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.10,0:10:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Things are getting messy, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.44,0:10:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Robin, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.68,0:10:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see Mingo?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.18,0:10:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, he makes me so mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.46,0:10:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole thing about Usopp's\Npretty hilarious, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.48,0:10:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.64,0:10:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw Rebecca was on that film list, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.58,0:10:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope she's doing okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.10,0:10:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,About Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.46,0:10:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm right here. Is that you, Lucy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.14,0:10:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, great timing, then. Guess what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.30,0:10:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The soldier's with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.46,0:11:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.88,0:11:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd that guy go, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.94,0:11:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Heavens, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.04,0:11:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.04,0:11:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What are the targets?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.12,0:11:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.72,0:11:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Soldier's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.92,0:11:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,He turned back into a human, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.50,0:11:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Lucy. What is he like?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.46,0:11:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a funny question.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.96,0:11:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean you don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.16,0:11:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That one-legged soldier, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.06,0:11:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He's your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.96,0:11:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He's also that badass statue guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.96,0:11:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.87,0:11:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't save her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.94,0:11:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.08,0:11:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.96,0:11:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This toy soldier is brave and true.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.88,0:11:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,In the rain or in the snow,\Nhe will stay with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.48,0:12:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's good, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.20,0:12:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He was just here, but\Ntook off, so I lost him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.46,0:12:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't start crying yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.20,0:12:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let this soldier die.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.00,0:12:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Be strong, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.56,0:12:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel kind of bad that I wouldn't\Nlet you have the flame flame fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.88,0:12:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I know why you wanted it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.24,0:12:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.12,0:12:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I can promise you one thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.84,0:12:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna give Doflamingo\Nthe beating of his life!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.64,0:12:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure you guys all\Nlive to see it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.90,0:12:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll end this stupid game in no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.70,0:12:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So stay safe! You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.90,0:12:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.68,0:12:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you even know what\Nyou're doing, Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.04,0:12:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you need a reminder.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.90,0:12:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We were supposed to destroy\Nthe factory in order
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.80,0:12:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,to provoke a conflict\Nbetween Kaido and Doflamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.16,0:13:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Did it ever cross your mind that if\Nwe prematurely kill that bastard,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.46,0:13:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,it'll only cause Kaido to\Nredirect his anger at us?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.56,0:13:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that what you really want?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.60,0:13:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,To take on a pissed-off emperor?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.14,0:13:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Things don't always work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.30,0:13:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.42,0:13:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you even think of the kingdom?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.56,0:13:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,If we chicken out now,\Nwhat'll happen to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.44,0:13:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Be on the lookout for those criminals
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.48,0:13:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Capturing them is going to be our only\Nway out of this. If you spot them,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.30,0:13:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,just shout And we'll back you up, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.38,0:13:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucky: I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.74,0:13:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Now stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.92,0:13:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not in control!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.90,0:13:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Admiral, what's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.38,0:13:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Get Doflamingo?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.06,0:13:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,These people need our help.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.98,0:14:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll restrain the rowdy ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.40,0:14:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, we'll set our\Nsights on Straw Hat and Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.12,0:14:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard me. Tell our men.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.74,0:14:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.65,0:14:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What about my handcuffs?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.26,0:14:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll fall off eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.10,0:14:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not how it works!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.84,0:14:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,One sec. I'll help.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.50,0:14:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You know where the key is?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.86,0:14:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wait. I'll look.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.42,0:14:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You know how we're getting there yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.74,0:14:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, straight through!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.74,0:14:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That fool, he's jumping!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.94,0:14:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.90,0:14:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Go Flamingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.48,0:14:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are so many people\Npouring out of the Coliseum?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.40,0:14:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.30,0:14:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole structure shifted.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.98,0:14:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I think they're coming\Nfrom the underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.12,0:14:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.03,0:14:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet they're the ex-toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.06,0:14:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Enraged soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.82,0:14:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Aggravated officials.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.48,0:15:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And rowdy pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.22,0:15:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't really blame them if they\Nriot as a result of their injustices.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.30,0:15:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,How did this many people go unnoticed?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.48,0:15:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Maynard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.56,0:15:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You owe me an explanation as to\Nwhy you entered the tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.06,0:15:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That was way out of line.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.32,0:15:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,you're lucky to be alive\Nreally just hear me out
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.14,0:15:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I got an inside look and\Nlearn some real dirty
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.30,0:15:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,details we gotta take\Nthe flamingo into custody
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.22,0:15:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you it's for\Nthe good of the whole
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.32,0:15:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,world an imposter pirate ship and\Nit's from the kingdom of big shots
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.66,0:15:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,so nations from all over the world\Nuse this port for secret deals?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.22,0:15:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, don't do it! I'm sorry. Honey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.56,0:15:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.22,0:16:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not, Isho?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.70,0:16:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo is unfit to be a warlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.80,0:16:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.62,0:16:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't make that call.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.28,0:16:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been doing it like that too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.60,0:16:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The same old song and dance every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.64,0:16:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been in the navy for\Nquite a while, if I recall.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.00,0:16:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Vice admiral, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.50,0:16:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you've never once\Nopened your ears this whole time!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.32,0:16:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear those screams?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.44,0:16:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not fear. It's rage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.12,0:16:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No, those aren't the\Ncries of terrified folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.08,0:16:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,They're furious.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.32,0:16:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why the world government\Nhas no business playing God.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.72,0:16:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,My decision stands.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.66,0:17:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This matter is not up for discussion,\Nso they're all after their smiles.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.36,0:17:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.64,0:17:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Doofy, I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.36,0:17:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't we need to protect the factory?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.34,0:17:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,They won't get by the doors!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.50,0:17:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They are Sea Prism Stone after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.90,0:17:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, I have the keys right here. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.46,0:17:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.56,0:17:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure that's smart?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.18,0:17:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't owe them a drop of hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.86,0:17:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Treble, you're useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.70,0:17:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe babysitting was\Nthat challenging for you, goon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.02,0:17:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the goon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.48,0:17:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, old man, she's not really a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.80,0:17:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, Toffee, I'm sorry about sugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.64,0:17:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't get mad at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.28,0:17:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy had his arms and legs bound.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.44,0:17:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't think he'd be able\Nto pull off a trick like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.88,0:17:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I really messed that up, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.28,0:18:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I too goofed, my bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.18,0:18:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't think I'd have to deal with the
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.22,0:18:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Revolutionary Army's\Nsecond-in-command all of a sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.62,0:18:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We just weren't ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.72,0:18:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.63,0:18:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit making excuses.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.64,0:18:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.98,0:18:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's with a capital Z!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.92,0:18:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's in the past, as far as I'm concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.04,0:18:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't turn back time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.68,0:18:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And blaming you wouldn't do me any good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.44,0:18:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.35,0:18:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why you're the\Nnumber one boss, Duffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.76,0:18:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Behehe!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.76,0:18:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hear that, Louji?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.26,0:18:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll accept your\Nforgiveness if you insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.78,0:18:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, what about Fujitora?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.22,0:18:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I think when push comes to\Nshove, he'll be a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.42,0:18:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I already had a chat with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.12,0:18:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I assure you the marines\Nwill stay off our backs.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.94,0:18:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But, once we're done using\Nhim, I need him gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.24,0:18:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't stop till I witness the complete\Nabolition of the Seven Warlords system.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.50,0:19:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No good will come from keeping him alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.88,0:19:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Although taking him out\Nwill be a real chore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.20,0:19:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure that's what you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.82,0:19:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you let me at them?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.06,0:19:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,His voice! Oh my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.96,0:19:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll thresh them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.42,0:19:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,By myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.22,0:19:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He's so true!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.64,0:19:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does such a huge dude\Nhave such a squeaky voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.14,0:19:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It always catches me off guard no\Nmatter how many times I hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.82,0:19:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to crack up one of these times\Nand he's going to put me through a wall!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.58,0:19:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need to rush things, Pika.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.18,0:19:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.26,0:19:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Patience is key.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.56,0:19:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You could consider this to\Nbe an election of sorts.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.98,0:19:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I humbly ask the kingdom of Dressrosa,\Nwho is more fit to be their ruler?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.40,0:19:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The Rick family or the Don Quixote family?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.76,0:20:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the people's right\Nto choose their king.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.18,0:20:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only fair, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.54,0:20:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We only need to stomp out the\Nones who directly oppose us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.08,0:20:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We can sit back and watch\Nthe rest devour one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.10,0:20:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But, Doofy, I'd rather...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.44,0:20:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, Master Pika. Forgive him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.12,0:20:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He's new around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.72,0:20:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He wasn't prepared to hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.80,0:20:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.42,0:20:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Buried forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.94,0:20:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be entombed in a sea of stones!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.60,0:20:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Lurtpika!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.18,0:20:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Gatling girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.28,0:20:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're gonna kill him, you can at\Nleast leave a body for his family.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.80,0:20:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, we're not evil, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.62,0:20:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a good point!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.78,0:20:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, BB-5!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.16,0:21:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I lost my mother at the tender age of\Neight, and killed my father when I was ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.96,0:21:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The members who hold ranks as executives\Nare whom I consider my closest family.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.14,0:21:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been through thick\Nand thin with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.50,0:21:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,They are all that I've got in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.90,0:21:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,To make just of any of them\Nis absolutely unforgivable.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.80,0:21:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.16,0:21:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.28,0:21:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's hit the next area.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.92,0:21:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Restrain anyone who's out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.04,0:21:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's find the Straw Hat Pirates\Nand Trafalgar Law. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.40,0:21:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.44,0:21:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like we are\Ninvisible to the Marines, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.86,0:21:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Agreed, I hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.18,0:21:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,They're showing respect\Nto the young master.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.06,0:21:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,but maybe it's all a set up or maybe they're\Nwetting their uniforms because of the
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.68,0:22:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,birdcage anyway what I want to know is how
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.78,0:22:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,that pervert found the strength to cut and
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.68,0:22:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,run also where the hell is he I bet that's
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.34,0:22:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,got to be the smile factory crazy how
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.06,0:22:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,it's out in the open like\Nthat it's practically
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.58,0:22:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,begging I'm looking for a laser beam.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.98,0:22:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is there a balloon fall in?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.06,0:22:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You must have some massive cojones\Non your showing up here. Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.56,0:22:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Big Brother Law all grown up?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.10,0:22:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Straw Hat Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.16,0:22:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And Trafalgar Law!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.08,0:22:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And the Pirate Hunter!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.58,0:22:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.49,0:23:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I should've picked a better spot!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.22,0:23:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.66,0:23:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,When these cuffs are off, I'll kill you\Nmyself! Come on, Law. Not his fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.18,0:23:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No place is safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.58,0:23:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Anywhere we land, everyone's an enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.50,0:23:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Now shut up! Let's run! Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.06,0:23:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,After them!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.04,0:23:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that way, Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.76,0:23:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that way either, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.18,0:23:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We found some of the fugitives.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.36,0:23:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's two\Nthree-stars and a two-star.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.56,0:23:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I tripped, some weird\Nswimming man baby grabbed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.26,0:23:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Vice, you're up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.24,0:23:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out, he'll crush you\Nwith his super weight powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.16,0:23:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.34,0:23:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't get free!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.34,0:23:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Last time I made a boo-boo.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.02,0:23:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Pistol high-heel!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.36,0:24:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.20,0:24:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.16,0:24:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,My legs are free! Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.16,0:24:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.02,0:24:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.00,0:24:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're worth 800 million berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.22,0:24:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll kill you. Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.04,0:24:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever you do, don't let them get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.18,0:24:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, what a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.92,0:24:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish the townsfolk would back off.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.26,0:24:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't feel right hurting them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.60,0:24:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'll use my Haki.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.62,0:24:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.58,0:24:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He who shoots often may sometimes\Nhit at last, but not in this case.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.88,0:25:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The Navy Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.98,0:25:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the gambling old guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.04,0:25:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard the five-star Usopp is somewhere\Naround here. Start searching! This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.30,0:25:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.92,0:25:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do they want me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.46,0:25:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Look up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.64,0:25:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of the terrain shift,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.08,0:25:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,the Coliseum Wall is now\Nconnected to the King's Plateau.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.68,0:25:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's take advantage of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.24,0:25:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We should find him somewhere up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.92,0:25:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca, run on ahead. Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.66,0:25:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a day game!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.32,0:25:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Bartolomeo.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.92,0:25:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hearing my name coming from Miss Robin's\Ncelestial lips gives me such a rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.22,0:25:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I could die.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.70,0:25:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go with Mr. Sniper King.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.84,0:25:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll hold off the enemy. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.06,0:25:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,She thanked a worthless drop like me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.24,0:26:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so fired up, ain't\Nno one gonna get through!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.18,0:26:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.48,0:26:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Just what are they attempting to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.62,0:26:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, not again!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.94,0:26:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.50,0:26:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.26,0:26:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,They're getting serious now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.48,0:26:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No use even fighting\Nback against that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.90,0:27:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, those pirates are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.70,0:27:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.12,0:27:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,A giant man is a huge wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.26,0:27:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,guy, pika, lord, pika, any
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.58,0:27:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,fool who opposes our\Nfamily will be answering to
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.86,0:28:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.77,0:28:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Now step forward and fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.64,0:28:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,His voice is so high.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.70,0:28:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.26,0:28:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How does that even? It didn't work!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.64,0:28:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Say something else!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.38,0:28:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Scraat!
